# EnvironmentPostProcessor discovery is still spring.factories-based in Spring Boot 3.1.x (only
# @AutoConfiguration classes moved to META-INF/spring/...AutoConfiguration.imports — this SPI did
# not). Verified against the real com.envpit:envpit-spring-boot-starter module in this same repo
# (sdks/java/envpit-spring-boot-starter/src/main/resources/META-INF/spring.factories), which
# documents having independently confirmed this by inspecting spring-boot-3.1.3.jar directly.
org.springframework.boot.env.EnvironmentPostProcessor=\
com.envpit.example.springboot.ExampleEnvpitEnvironmentPostProcessor
